### ── Sorties de stock ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 11. POST /api/stocks/sorties — nominal, perte physique (casse)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stocks/sorties
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMagasinierPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entrepotId": "{{entrepotPnaId}}",
  "lotId": "{{lotParacetamolProcheId}}",
  "quantite": 10,
  "typeMouvement": "CASSE",
  "motif": "Cartons endommagés durant la manutention"
}


### 12. POST /api/stocks/sorties — cas limite, sortie consommant une réservation existante (depuisReservation=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stocks/sorties
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMagasinierPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entrepotId": "{{entrepotPnaId}}",
  "lotId": "{{lotCeftriaxoneId}}",
  "quantite": 50,
  "typeMouvement": "SORTIE_STRUCTURE",
  "depuisReservation": true,
  "referenceDocument": "CMD-TEST-{{$timestamp}}"
}


### 13. POST /api/stocks/sorties — cas limite, transfert vers un autre entrepôt (entrepotDestinationId renseigné)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stocks/sorties
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMagasinierPna.response.body.$.results.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entrepotId": "{{entrepotPnaId}}",
  "lotId": "{{lotParacetamolLointainId}}",
  "quantite": 200,
  "typeMouvement": "SORTIE_TRANSFERT",
  "entrepotDestinationId": "{{entrepotPraDakarId}}",
  "referenceDocument": "TRF-TEST-{{$timestamp}}"
}


